@host = http://localhost:8081/api
# Replace token and IDs after logging in.
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@companyId = 1

### Register (one time)
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"fullName":"Repair Owner","email":"owner@example.com","password":"DemoPassword123!","phone":"123456"}

### Login — copy accessToken into @token above
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"owner@example.com","password":"DemoPassword123!"}

### Profile
GET {{host}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Public active companies
GET {{host}}/catalog/companies

### Create a company
POST {{host}}/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Repair Shop","email":"shop@example.com","phone":"123456","address":"Main Street","currencyCode":"EUR"}

### My company memberships
GET {{host}}/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Company financial dashboard (owner only)
GET {{host}}/companies/{{companyId}}/finance/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### My repairs (customer)
GET {{host}}/companies/{{companyId}}/repairs/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Platform finance (requires SUPER_ADMIN)
GET {{host}}/platform/finance/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
